]"}
{"model": "mistral:7b", "case_id": "rag_9", "category": "rag", "expected_tool": "rag_tool", "called_tool": null, "tool_call_raw": null, "tool_json_valid": false, "tool_correct": false, "final_text": " To identify misinformation or fake news, the reference documentation (base de conocimiento) considers the following criteria:\n\n1. Verification of the source: Checking if the source is reliable and trustworthy.\n2. Verification of the information: Cross-checking the information with multiple sources to ensure its accuracy.\n3. Verification of the context: Analyzing the context in which the information is presented to determine if it is being presented in a misleading or manipulative manner.\n4. Verification of the timeliness: Ensuring that the information is up-to-date and not outdated.\n5. Verification of the format: Checking if the information is presented in a format that is likely to be misleading or manipulative, such as deepfakes or altered images/videos.\n6. Verification of the consistency: Cross-checking the information with other known facts to ensure its consistency.\n7. Verification of the relevance: Determining if the information is relevant to the current situation or if it is being presented out of context.\n8. Verification of the purpose: Analyzing the purpose of the information to determine if it is being presented for manipulation or deception.\n9. Verification of the audience: Considering the target audience of the information to determine if it is being presented in a way that is likely to be misleading or manipulative to that audience.\n10. Verification of the evidence: Requiring evidence to support the claims made in the information.\n\nThese criteria help in identifying and verifying the authenticity of the information, ensuring that the content is accurate, relevant, and not intended to deceive or manipulate the audience.", "latency_s": 6.178334100000939, "error": null, "quality_score": null, "quality_reasoning": "[error al juzgar: 404 Client Error: Not Found for url: http://localhost:11434/api/chat]"}
