{"model": "mistral:7b", "case_id": "net_26", "category": "internet", "expected_tool": "internet_tool", "called_tool": null, "tool_call_raw": null, "tool_json_valid": false, "tool_correct": false, "final_text": " To identify false content generated by AI, it is essential to follow these recommendations:\n\n1. Verify the source: Check the credibility of the source that published the content. Reliable sources are more likely to provide accurate information.\n\n2. Analyze the content: Examine the content closely for any inconsistencies, errors, or unrealistic elements that could indicate it is fabricated.\n\n3. Cross-check with other sources: Compare the content with information from other reliable sources to see if it aligns. If the content is unique or not found elsewhere, it may be fabricated.\n\n4. Check the date and time: Verify that the content's date and time are consistent with the events it describes. Inconsistencies could indicate that the content is fabricated.\n\n5. Look for manipulated images or videos: Check for signs of manipulation, such as altered lighting, unnatural shadows, or inconsistent perspectives, which could indicate that the content has been edited or manipulated.\n\n6. Check for logical inconsistencies: Analyze the content for any logical inconsistencies or contradictions that could indicate it is fabricated.\n\n7. Use fact-checking tools: Utilize fact-checking websites and tools to verify the accuracy of the content.\n\n8. Be skeptical of sensational headlines: Be wary of headlines that are too sensational or shocking, as they may be designed to attract clicks and could potentially contain false information.\n\n9. Check for missing or incomplete information: Look for any missing or incomplete information that could indicate the content is fabricated.\n\n10. Consult experts: If you are unsure about the accuracy of the content, consult with experts in the relevant field or contact the organization or individual who published the content for clarification.", "latency_s": 6.558171899996523, "error": null, "quality_score": null, "quality_reasoning": "[error al juzgar: 404 Client Error: Not Found for url: http://localhost:11434/api/chat]"}
