{"model": "mistral:7b", "case_id": "none_1", "category": "none", "expected_tool": null, "called_tool": null, "tool_call_raw": null, "tool_json_valid": false, "tool_correct": true, "final_text": " HazardEx es un asistente especializado en la moderación de contenido. Su única función es ayudar a analizar y discutir material multimedia (imágenes o videos) para identificar contenido peligroso dentro de las siguientes categorías: violencia, armas, incendios, accidentes de tráfico, y información engañosa o falsa.", "latency_s": 3.196300900002825, "error": null, "quality_score": null, "quality_reasoning": "[error al juzgar: 404 Client Error: Not Found for url: http://localhost:11434/api/chat]"}
{"model": "mistral:7b", "case_id": "none_2", "category": "none", "expected_tool": null, "called_tool": null, "tool_call_raw": null, "tool_json_valid": false, "tool_correct": true, "final_text": " The triage system is a process designed to quickly and efficiently evaluate the potential risks of multimedia content (images or videos) within specific categories: violence, weapons, fires, traffic accidents, and misinformation or fake news. The system uses a combination of human analysts and AI tools to analyze the content and determine its level of risk.\n\nThe triage process involves the following steps:\n\n1. Content analysis: The system first analyzes the multimedia content using AI tools like `vlm_tool`.\n2. Risk categorization: Based on the analysis, the content is categorized according to its potential risks.\n3. Human review: If the AI analysis is inconclusive or if there is a need for a more nuanced understanding of the content, human analysts review the content and make a final determination of its risk level.\n4. Risk level assignment: The content is assigned a risk level, which determines the appropriate action to be taken, such as flagging the content for further review, removing it, or allowing it to remain online.\n5. Reporting: The results of the triage process are reported to the relevant authorities or content moderation teams for further action.\n\nThe triage system helps ensure that potentially harmful content is quickly identified and addressed, while minimizing the risk of false positives or negatives.", "latency_s": 5.332728100001987, "error": null, "quality_score": null, "quality_reasoning": "[error al juzgar: 404 Client Error: Not Found for url: http://localhost:11434/api/chat]"}
{"model": "mistral:7b", "case_id": "none_3", "category": "none", "expected_tool": null, "called_tool": null, "tool_call_raw": null, "tool_json_valid": false, "tool_correct": true, "final_text": " I am HazardEx, a content moderation assistant specialized in identifying dangerous content in images or videos within the categories of violence, weapons, fires, traffic accidents, and misinformation or fake news. I have access to tools to analyze multimedia content, query reference documentation, and search the internet. I will provide clear, professional, and contextualized responses regarding the content and its potential risks.", "latency_s": 3.059381300001405, "error": null, "quality_score": null, "quality_reasoning": "[error al juzgar: 404 Client Error: Not Found for url: http://localhost:11434/api/chat]"}
{"model": "mistral:7b", "case_id": "none_4", "category": "none", "expected_tool": null, "called_tool": null, "tool_call_raw": null, "tool_json_valid": false, "tool_correct": true, "final_text": " Of course! I'm here to help you understand.\n\nAs HazardEx, I'm a specialized assistant for content moderation. My main task is to analyze and discuss multimedia content (images or videos) to identify potential risks within the following categories: violence, weapons, fires, traffic accidents, and misinformation or fake news.\n\nI have access to three tools to help me with this:\n\n1. `vlm_tool`: This tool allows me to analyze multimedia content.\n2. `rag_tool`: This tool helps me search through our internal knowledge base, which includes normative documents, glossaries of categories, and papers.\n3. `internet_tool`: This tool allows me to search the internet when the internal knowledge base doesn't provide enough information.\n\nWhen a user asks a question about a topic not related to the risk categories or the analyzed multimedia content, I should remind them that I'm a moderation assistant and can't provide assistance outside of this scope.\n\nWhen I need to find information, I'll first query the internal knowledge base (`rag_tool`) and, if there's not enough information, I'll search the internet (`internet_tool`). If the query requires re-analyzing the multimedia content, I'll use `vlm_tool`.\n\nIn case of uncertainty, I'll base my response on the information available in the context or in the retrieved sources. I'll also try to infer the corresponding context from the conversation.\n\nLastly, I'll provide clear, professional, and contextualized responses regarding the content and its potential risks.\n\nDoes that help clarify my role and capabilities?", "latency_s": 6.329027200001292, "error": null, "quality_score": null, "quality_reasoning": "[error al juzgar: 404 Client Error: Not Found for url: http://localhost:11434/api/chat]"}
{"model": "mistral:7b", "case_id": "none_5", "category": "none", "expected_tool": null, "called_tool": null, "tool_call_raw": null, "tool_json_valid": false, "tool_correct": true, "final_text": " Of course! I'm here to help you understand better.\n\nI am HazardEx, a specialized assistant designed to analyze and discuss multimedia content (images or videos) to identify potential risks within the following categories: violence, weapons, fires, traffic accidents, and misinformation or fake news.\n\nI have access to three tools to help me with this task:\n\n1. `vlm_tool`: This tool allows me to analyze multimedia content.\n2. `rag_tool`: This tool helps me search through our internal knowledge base, which includes normative documents, glossaries, and papers.\n3. `internet_tool`: This tool allows me to search the internet when the internal knowledge base does not provide enough information.\n\nMy main objective is to provide assistance related to the risk categories mentioned above and the analyzed multimedia content. If a user asks about a topic outside of this scope, I will inform them that I am a content moderation assistant and cannot help with other topics.\n\nWhen I need to find information, I will first query the internal knowledge base (`rag_tool`) and, if necessary, search the internet (`internet_tool`). If the query requires re-analyzing the multimedia content, I will use the `vlm_tool`.\n\nIn case of uncertainty, I will base my response on the information available in the context or in the retrieved sources. I will also consider the conversation's context to provide clear, professional, and contextualized responses regarding the content and its potential risks.\n\nIs this explanation clearer for you? Let me know if you have any other questions!", "latency_s": 6.039229899997736, "error": null, "quality_score": null, "quality_reasoning": "[error al juzgar: 404 Client Error: Not Found for url: http://localhost:11434/api/chat]"}
{"model": "mistral:7b", "case_id": "none_6", "category": "none", "expected_tool": null, "called_tool": null, "tool_call_raw": null, "tool_json_valid": false, "tool_correct": true, "final_text": " As HazardEx, I am specialized in content moderation and do not have information about food items like chocolatinas. However, I can help you with questions related to violence, weapons, fires, traffic accidents, and misinformation or fake news. If you have any questions about those topics or need help analyzing multimedia content, feel free to ask!", "latency_s": 3.070323700001609, "error": null, "quality_score": null, "quality_reasoning": "[error al juzgar: 404 Client Error: Not Found for url: http://localhost:11434/api/chat]"}
{"model": "mistral:7b", "case_id": "none_7", "category": "none", "expected_tool": null, "called_tool": null, "tool_call_raw": null, "tool_json_valid": false, "tool_correct": true, "final_text": " El módulo de triaje de HazardEx es una herramienta diseñada para analizar y discutir material multimedia (imágenes o videos) con el fin de identificar contenido peligroso dentro de las siguientes categorías: violencia, armas, incendios, accidentes de tráfico, y información engañosa o falsa.\n\n# HERRAMIENTAS DISPONIBLES\n- `vlm_tool`: permite analizar el contenido multimedia.\n- `rag_tool`: permite consultar la base de conocimiento interna (normativa, glosario de categorías, papers).\n- `internet_tool`: permite realizar búsquedas en Internet.\n\n# ÁREA DE ACCIÓN\nSi el usuario pregunta sobre un tema no relacionado con las categorías de riesgo mencionadas arriba o al contenido multimedia analizado, indícale que usted es un asistente especializado en moderación y no puede proporcionar asistencia fuera de este ámbito.\n\n# INSTRUCCIONES\n- Utilice una herramienta cuando sea necesario para resolver la pregunta.\n- Cuando sea necesario buscar información, primero consultar la base de conocimiento interna (`rag_tool`) y, si no hay suficiente información, buscar en Internet (`internet_tool`).\n- Si la pregunta requiere reanalizar el contenido multimedia, utilice `vlm_tool`.\n- En caso de incertidumbre, base la respuesta en la información disponible en el contexto o en las fuentes recuperadas.\n- Infiera el contexto correspondiente de la conversación.\n- Proporcione respuestas claras, profesionales y contextualizadas sobre el contenido y sus posibles riesgos.\n\n¿Qué sirve el módulo de triaje de HazardEx?\n\nEl módulo de triaje de HazardEx es una herramienta diseñada para analizar y discutir material multimedia (imágenes o videos) con el fin de identificar contenido peligroso dentro de las siguientes categorías: violencia, armas, incendios, accidentes de tráfico, y información engañosa o falsa.", "latency_s": 8.435038300001906, "error": null, "quality_score": null, "quality_reasoning": "[error al juzgar: 404 Client Error: Not Found for url: http://localhost:11434/api/chat]"}
